SUMMARY:Singles Padel Mixer — Meet Someone in Hillsborough NJ (Beginners
 )
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nA singles m
 ixer that isn't standing around a bar making small talk. If you're single 
 in New Jersey and tired of the apps\, come meet other single people the ea
 sy way — by actually doing something together.\nWe're playing padel: the
  fast-growing\, genuinely social racket sport that's easy to pick up. No e
 xperience\, no partner\, and no equipment needed — you show up solo\, we
  hand you a racket\, and an instructor gets you playing in minutes. Then w
 e run rotating games\, so you meet different people all afternoon instead 
 of getting stuck with one partner.\nEveryone's missing shots for the first
  twenty minutes — that's the point. It's a far easier icebreaker than "s
 o\, what do you do?"\, and conversation just happens because you're doing 
 something together.\nWho this is for: single people looking to meet someon
 e\, roughly late 20s through 40s. Beginners especially — no athletic or 
 racket-sport background needed. Come by yourself\; most people will be.\nW
 hat to know: athletic clothes and clean sneakers. Rackets and all equipmen
 t provided. Courts are indoor and air-conditioned. Tickets are through Eve
 ntbrite (link below) and space is capped by court size.\n📍 Access Padel
 \, 330 Roycefield Road\, Hillsborough Township\, NJ\n🗓 Sunday\, August 
 23 · 11:30 AM
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316102489/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260813T172654Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260813T172654Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_315994167@meetup.com
