DTSTAMP:20260822T020943Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260826T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260826T230000
SUMMARY:Dave & Buster's (Wednesday\, West Nyack)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nFor those w
 ho want to socialize first maybe we can play pool for the first hour or so
  since it's easier to converse this way. But pool is $6/hr cash only so yo
 u can't use your game card for this. Or just get food and drinks or both. 
 Then after that we can hit the arcade games.\n\nWednesday is half price fo
 r all games except VR. Everyone is responsible for all their own food/drin
 ks games. If sharing games like pool then please split the cost evenly bet
 ween each participant.\n\nI’m generally thinking: 1. grab a drink/food/c
 hat (maybe pool if there's enough interest) 2. try to generally stick toge
 ther\, watch\, and rotate in for various games. I’m down for pool and an
 y 2 or more person arcade games like racing or shooters and maybe even pri
 ze games too! Please feel free to let us know what your preferences will b
 e.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315994167/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260805T213029Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260805T213029Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_315829901@meetup.com
