DTSTAMP:20260822T020943Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260828T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260828T213000
SUMMARY:Bowling Night - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nThis is an 
 event for casual bowling at Montvale Lanes\, 14 W. Grand Ave. All are welc
 ome for **two games\, food and drinks**\, and any post- or pre-game hang o
 ut. Show up anytime! Questions or comments? You can message Andy Milone on
  Meetup\, or call/text him at **201-234-9609**.\n\n\\*\\*\\* Before bowlin
 g\, we might stop by the Pizza Parlour\, 6 S. Kinderkamack Road in Montval
 e\, for a few slices. Post a comment on the event page to gauge interest. 
 **After bowling\, we'll definitely be heading to The Ridge Diner\, 125 Kin
 derkamack Road in Park Ridge\, at 10:15 p.m. for some food and/or drinks.*
 * \\*\\*\\*\n\nAbout the group: People of all ages\, backgrounds and abili
 ties are welcome! We're not professionals and we're not in a league. In fa
 ct\, we're a group of people who probably each won't score more than 100 p
 oints and will land more than our fair share of gutter balls. There's no p
 ressure at all!!!! We're not here to analyze your form or technique.\n\nMo
 re event details: You pay for your own games\, food and drinks. Please bri
 ng cash. The alley does not accept card. But there is an ATM on site. **Th
 e** **cost per player is $18 for two games** **and bowling shoes.** If you
  have your own shoes\, the cost is $12. Please try to bring exact change s
 ince Andy will have a limited amount of cash. If you bring a $20 bill and 
 he doesn't have change\, any remainder would just go toward the bowling al
 ley tip.\n\nFood and drinks (alcoholic and non-alcoholic) are available on
  site\, plus tables and an alley bar to hang at during the event. There is
  a dart board and a few arcade games\, as well.\n\n**What do you do when y
 ou get there?** Find the group inside around the front desk. Look for a gr
 owing group of people! Call or text Andy Milone at 201-234-9609 if you can
 't find us. Once Andy secures the lanes\, please pay him before getting yo
 ur bowling shoes and heading to the lanes.\n\n**Please know that it is pos
 sible we have to wait 20-40 minutes until lane(s) free up.** It's also pos
 sible that we may have to relocate or cancel that night if there's a long 
 wait list upon arrival. Please keep that in mind if traveling from far awa
 y!\n\nFor those who don't have cars or are looking to avoid driving\, the 
 Montvale Train Station is only like a five-minute walk from the bowling al
 ley and can be reached via the Pascack Valley Line. Last train leaves at 1
 2:20 a.m. and heads toward Hoboken. (https://gmtma.org/wp-content/uploads/
 2011/11/rail_system_map.jpg)\n\nMany thanks to Taylor\, one of our group p
 articipants\, for recommending Montvale Lanes! You can learn more at: www.
 montvalelanes.com.\n\nHope you'll join us for our 26th bowling event\, or 
 consider attending one of our volleyball\, ping pong\, skating or other ac
 tivities -> www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball\n\nIf in
 terested in staying touch with group members or conversing about future ev
 ents\, feel free to inquire about our WhatsApp group chat.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315829901/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260725T070016Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260725T070016Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
